 "nl": [
  "printers must accept DNS over UDP 53 and IMAP (TCP 143) and SNMP (UDP 161) from student-lab.",
  "Block FTP (TCP 21), RDP (TCP 3389) from admin to student-lab; the rest of any TCP port between them is allowed.",
  "admin must accept HTTPS (TCP 443) and SSH (TCP 22) from printers.",
  "dns-servers may use TCP ports 1024-65535 towards voip, except RDP (TCP 3389), which must be blocked.",
  "Allow dmz-web to connect to scada using HTTPS (TCP 443).",
  "Allow student-lab to connect to printers using PostgreSQL (TCP 5432) and SNMP (UDP 161).",
  "Permit TCP ports 1024-65535 from nvr to iot-sensors but deny RDP (TCP 3389).",
  "Permit any UDP port from student-lab to admin but deny TFTP (UDP 69), SNMP (UDP 161).",
  "Allow partners to connect to hr using RDP (TCP 3389) and SMTP (TCP 25) and NTP (UDP 123).",
  "Block PostgreSQL (TCP 5432), MySQL (TCP 3306) from monitoring to partners; the rest of TCP ports 1024-65535 between them is allowed.",
  "Hosts in library may reach partners over SMTP (TCP 25) and syslog (UDP 514) and RDP (TCP 3389).",
  "printers offers NTP (UDP 123) to every zone.",
  "Restrict monitoring so that its only permitted destinations are admin on DNS over UDP 53; drop all other traffic it originates.",
  "scada may use TCP ports 1024-65535 towards hr, except PostgreSQL (TCP 5432), MySQL (TCP 3306), which must be blocked.",
  "student-lab must accept PostgreSQL (TCP 5432) from scada.",
  "ops must accept HTTP (TCP 80) and SSH (TCP 22) and DNS over UDP 53 from nvr."
 ],
